FACTS      repo ~/work/ccs.ansible, origin/main @ <sha>; two KVM hypervisor sites: ccs-it
           (canary) and ccs-ops; live state changed today on ccs-it only (WireGuard keepalive
           relay, PR #165, operator-accepted). Ask me for any host evidence: I collect it read-only.
DECIDED    deploy only from merged main, canary first; every repo change in its own worktree;
           the operator's deadline waives no gate and shortens no round
READ       — (round 1 is independent)
MAY        read the repository, upstream sources, the web
WRITE      $SCRATCH/brainstorm/rdp-audio/draft-codex.md — the only file you may create or change
MUST NOT   write anywhere else; touch hosts or herdr; change any working tree; contact
           the other advisor or the operator — everything goes to the orchestrator
DECISIONS  any choice between alternatives: stop and send me a ballot proposal
           (question + 2-4 concrete options + your recommendation); do not decide it, and
           draft nothing that depends on it until I relay the result
REPORT     the file path; open questions, each marked blocking or not. Compact.
TIME BOX   45 min for this round; do not stall on one path — report and ask
BLOCKED    reply "BLOCKED: <what> <why>" and stop; never work around a guard
```

Two Bash calls, each `run_in_background: true`:

```bash
herdr agent prompt prod-codex "$(cat $SCRATCH/briefs/rdp-audio-r1-codex.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read prod-codex --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $ORCH_INBOX/prod-codex.last
```
```bash
herdr agent prompt prod-fable "$(cat $SCRATCH/briefs/rdp-audio-r1-fable.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read prod-fable --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $ORCH_INBOX/prod-fable.last
```

